# ─── SMTP Email Configuration for OTP Delivery ──────────────────────
# For Gmail:
# 1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on your Google Account.
# 2. Go to myaccount.google.com/apppasswords and generate a 16-character "App Password".
# 3. Use that App Password in SMTP_PASSWORD (without spaces).

